# Instructor material -- deliberately NOT published.
#
# run_of_show.md and the two notes_*.md files contain the answers to the
# predict-then-run questions the notebooks are built around (the bipolar
# cathodic/anodic ratio is exactly 1.00; modulation depth at the centre of the
# crossed montage is 0%). Publishing them next to the notebooks would defeat
# the design. maintainer/ holds the publishing scripts, which students have no
# use for.
#
# The one instructor-side document that IS public is the safety and equipment
# sheet, which lives at SAFETY.md in the repository root: students need to read
# the exclusion criteria and consent script before volunteering, and anyone
# reusing this material needs the kit list.
instructor/

# Empty scratch directory from the restructure
docs/
.DS_Store
